[{"id":1781766348392,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"823d41d3-a739-4c7f-ad03-55f7bd53cf24","senderName":"Keegan","text":"If it’s that cheap, you should probably check the expiration date. Twice.","timestamp":"2026-06-18T04:52:27.329Z","translation":"如果真那么便宜，你最好检查一下保质期。查两次。","roundId":"group_round_1781758305555_kjkrx96","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"group_1781738081642","_id":4359},{"id":1781766348393,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","senderName":"Krueger","text":"表情包：开心","timestamp":"2026-06-18T04:52:27.760Z","sticker":"https://img.cdn1.vip/i/69c5452e729de_1774535982.gif","stickerMeaning":"开心","roundId":"group_round_1781758305555_kjkrx96","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"group_1781738081642","_id":4360},{"id":1781766348394,"sender":"them","text":"Next time, just tell me if you're that broke. I'll send you something that doesn't cost less than a bloody bandage.","timestamp":"2026-06-18T04:52:30.822Z","source":"group_dm","groupId":"group_1781738081642","groupName":"Krueger、Simon Riley、Keegan...","translation":"下次要是真穷成那样就直说。我会给你寄点东西，起码价格不会比那该死的绷带还便宜。","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"7309238e-d722-4aaa-a30c-9223d595723a","_id":4361},{"id":1781766348395,"sender":"them","text":"So, a 'cheap' employee price for a 'cheap' little girl? I'm starting to think I overpaid for that favor this morning.","timestamp":"2026-06-18T04:52:33.993Z","source":"group_dm","groupId":"group_1781738081642","groupName":"Krueger、Simon Riley、Keegan...","translation":"所以，给“廉价”小女孩的“廉价”员工价？我开始觉得今天早上那个人情我开价开高了。","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","_id":4362},{"id":1781766348396,"sender":"me","text":"有啊当然有啊","replyTo":{"id":1781766348388,"text":"Gibt es Fleisch? Is there... meat in it? You need protein if you're working that much.","sender":"them","senderName":"König"},"timestamp":"2026-06-18T04:52:56.294Z","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"group_1781738081642","_id":4363},{"id":1781766348397,"sender":"me","text":"噎着了就索赔公司","replyTo":{"id":1781766348386,"text":"Employee price or not, you get what you pay for. Don't choke on it.","sender":"them","senderName":"Simon Riley"},"timestamp":"2026-06-18T04:53:25.932Z","reactions":["🙄"],"userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"group_1781738081642","_id":4364},{"id":1781766348398,"sender":"me","text":"让公司赔我点钱","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-06-18T04:53:31.600Z","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"group_1781738081642","_id":4365},{"id":1781766348399,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","senderName":"Krueger","text":"Suing for compensation? Now you're speaking my language. Need a professional witness? I don't come cheap, but I'm very convincing.","timestamp":"2026-06-18T04:53:51.982Z","translation":"索赔？你现在开始说我听得懂的话了。需要专业证人吗？我收费不低，但我很有说服力。","roundId":"group_round_1781758412396_hzj8j1d","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"group_1781738081642","_id":4366},{"id":1781766348400,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"7309238e-d722-4aaa-a30c-9223d595723a","senderName":"Simon Riley","text":"They’d probably argue that for two point five yuan, you should’ve expected the hazard. Don't be an idiot.","timestamp":"2026-06-18T04:53:54.771Z","replyTo":{"id":1781766348398,"text":"让公司赔我点钱","sender":"me","senderName":""},"translation":"他们可能会辩称，看在两块五的面子上，你应该预料到这种风险。别犯傻。","roundId":"group_round_1781758412396_hzj8j1d","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"group_1781738081642","_id":4367},{"id":1781766348401,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"876f70e0-1f99-4303-8942-b51f215c8cfe","senderName":"König","text":"Fleisch... is it real? Or just... mystery meat? I have seen things in field rations that look like meat but are not.","timestamp":"2026-06-18T04:53:59.906Z","translation":"肉……是真的吗？还是某种……神秘肉类？我在野战口粮里见过一些看起来像肉但其实不是的东西。","roundId":"group_round_1781758412396_hzj8j1d","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"group_1781738081642","_id":4368},{"id":1781766348402,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"823d41d3-a739-4c7f-ad03-55f7bd53cf24","senderName":"Keegan","text":"If you're planning a lawsuit, make sure you don't actually die first. Dead people can't spend compensation money.","timestamp":"2026-06-18T04:54:02.760Z","translation":"如果你打算起诉，先确保你没真的死掉。死人可没法花赔偿金。","roundId":"group_round_1781758412396_hzj8j1d","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"group_1781738081642","_id":4369},{"id":1781766348403,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"8d279dcf-8bd7-42cb-9c2e-360a084898f7","senderName":"Nikto","text":"(Она хочет использовать систему. Это забавно.) Money is a good motivator. But your health is ours to monitor.","timestamp":"2026-06-18T04:54:05.461Z","translation":"(她想利用规则。这很有趣。) 金钱是个很好的动力。但你的健康由我们监视。","roundId":"group_round_1781758412396_hzj8j1d","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"group_1781738081642","_id":4370},{"id":1781766348404,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","senderName":"Krueger","text":"表情包：good","timestamp":"2026-06-18T04:54:06.043Z","sticker":"https://img.cdn1.vip/i/69c5452e52d7d_1774535982.gif","stickerMeaning":"good","roundId":"group_round_1781758412396_hzj8j1d","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"group_1781738081642","_id":4371},{"id":1781766348405,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"823d41d3-a739-4c7f-ad03-55f7bd53cf24","senderName":"Keegan","text":"@König Don't scare her. It's probably just heavily processed pork.","timestamp":"2026-06-18T04:54:09.389Z","translation":"@König 别吓她。那大概只是深加工过的猪肉。","roundId":"group_round_1781758412396_hzj8j1d","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"group_1781738081642","_id":4372},{"id":1781766348406,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","senderName":"Krueger","text":"@渡峥 Just don't choke on a bone. That would be a very 'cheap' way to go.","timestamp":"2026-06-18T04:54:11.105Z","translation":"@渡峥 只要别被骨头噎着就行。那死法可太‘廉价’了。","roundId":"group_round_1781758412396_hzj8j1d","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"group_1781738081642","_id":4373},{"id":1781766348407,"sender":"them","text":"If you're actually hungry, stop joking about lawsuits and buy some real food. I'll cover the bill.","timestamp":"2026-06-18T04:54:14.287Z","source":"group_dm","groupId":"group_1781738081642","groupName":"Krueger、Simon Riley、Keegan...","translation":"如果你真的饿了，就别拿诉讼开玩笑了，去买点真正的食物。我买单。","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"7309238e-d722-4aaa-a30c-9223d595723a","_id":4374},{"id":1781766348408,"sender":"them","text":"I could make the 'choking' look very real for a 30% cut of that compensation. Think about it, Kleine.","timestamp":"2026-06-18T04:54:17.359Z","source":"group_dm","groupId":"group_1781738081642","groupName":"Krueger、Simon Riley、Keegan...","translation":"我可以让那场‘噎住’看起来非常真实，只要分我30%的赔偿金。考虑一下，小姑娘。","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","_id":4375},{"id":1781757346771,"text":"瞎说什么呢","sender":"me","time":"12:54","timestamp":1781758465656,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"7309238e-d722-4aaa-a30c-9223d595723a","_id":4376},{"id":1781757346772,"text":"就是普通的饭菜吧","sender":"me","time":"12:54","timestamp":1781758471340,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"7309238e-d722-4aaa-a30c-9223d595723a","_id":4377},{"id":1781757346773,"text":"不至于","sender":"me","time":"12:54","timestamp":1781758482015,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"7309238e-d722-4aaa-a30c-9223d595723a","_id":4378},{"id":1781757346774,"text":"等会吃穷你哦","sender":"me","time":"12:56","timestamp":1781758606904,"replyTo":{"id":1781766348394,"text":"Next time, just tell me if you're that broke. I'll send you something that doesn't cost less than a bloody bandage.","sender":"them","isSimulated":false},"userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"7309238e-d722-4aaa-a30c-9223d595723a","_id":4379},{"id":1781757346775,"text":"说什么呢","sender":"me","time":"12:56","timestamp":1781758618012,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","_id":4380},{"id":1781757346776,"text":"开玩笑的","sender":"me","time":"12:57","timestamp":1781758620247,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","_id":4381},{"id":1781757346777,"text":"不会真出事的啊！","sender":"me","time":"12:57","timestamp":1781758625947,"replyTo":null,"reactions":[{"emoji":"😆","roundId":"round_1781758729015_ylmnmzndp"}],"userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","_id":4382},{"id":1781757346779,"sender":"them","text":"Oh? So you're not planning on making a quick fortune by choking on a mystery meat bone anymore?","timestamp":1781758741482,"tempo":"N","translation":"哦？所以你不打算靠被那块来历不明的肉噎住来发横财了？","hasThinking":true,"rawContent":"Oh? So you're not planning on making a quick fortune by choking on a mystery meat bone anymore? || 哦？所以你不打算靠被那块来历不明的肉噎住来发横财了？","roundId":"round_1781758729015_ylmnmzndp","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","_id":4383},{"id":1781757346780,"sender":"them","text":"I'm hurt. You think I'd actually let you die for 2.5 yuan?","timestamp":1781758744203,"tempo":"R","translation":"我伤心了。你觉得我会为了区区两块五就真的让你死掉？","rawContent":"I'm hurt. You think I'd actually let you die for 2.5 yuan? || 我伤心了。你觉得我会为了区区两块五就真的让你死掉？","roundId":"round_1781758729015_ylmnmzndp","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","_id":4384},{"id":1781757346781,"sender":"them","text":"I have much higher standards for my 'business partners'.","timestamp":1781758745966,"tempo":"N","translation":"我对我的“合作伙伴”可是有更高标准的。","rawContent":"I have much higher standards for my 'business partners'. || 我对我的“合作伙伴”可是有更高标准的。","roundId":"round_1781758729015_ylmnmzndp","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","_id":4385},{"id":1781757346782,"sender":"them","text":"[語音消息]","timestamp":1781758748869,"tempo":"N","isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"Relax, Kleine. If you're going to choke, it'll be because I'm around, and I'll be the one deciding when you can breathe again. Not some cheap cafeteria food.","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"calm","translation":"放松点，小姑娘。如果你真要喘不过气，那也得是因为我在你身边，而且得由我来决定你什么时候能重新呼吸。而不是因为什么廉价的食堂饭菜。","rawContent":"[語音消息] || 放松点，小姑娘。如果你真要喘不过气，那也得是因为我在你身边，而且得由我来决定你什么时候能重新呼吸。而不是因为什么廉价的食堂饭菜。","roundId":"round_1781758729015_ylmnmzndp","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","_id":4386},{"id":1781766348409,"sender":"me","text":"[圖片]","timestamp":"2026-06-18T05:09:29.987Z","imageSummary":"绿色桌面上摆放着六个透明的小白酒杯，杯座上贴着橙色圆点编号，背景有橙色宣传单。","imageRef":13,"userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"group_1781738081642","_id":4387},{"id":1781766348410,"sender":"me","text":"我要学品酒","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-06-18T05:09:36.258Z","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"group_1781738081642","_id":4388},{"id":1781766348411,"sender":"me","text":"哈哈哈哈","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-06-18T05:09:38.314Z","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"group_1781738081642","_id":4389},{"id":1781766348412,"sender":"me","text":"六个白酒杯","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-06-18T05:09:41.799Z","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"group_1781738081642","_id":4390},{"id":1781766348413,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","senderName":"Krueger","text":"Learning to taste? Or just looking for an excuse to get drunk at 1 PM? That's a lot of glasses for a 'beginner'.","timestamp":"2026-06-18T05:10:03.318Z","translation":"学习品酒？还是只是想找个借口在下午一点把自己灌醉？对于一个“初学者”来说，这杯子可够多的。","roundId":"group_round_1781759382770_qr7bja9","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"group_1781738081642","_id":4391},{"id":1781766348414,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"7309238e-d722-4aaa-a30c-9223d595723a","senderName":"Simon Riley","text":"That stuff is like jet fuel. You'll be horizontal before the fourth glass. Don't say I didn't warn you.","timestamp":"2026-06-18T05:10:06.232Z","replyTo":{"id":1781766348410,"text":"我要学品酒","sender":"me","senderName":""},"translation":"那玩意儿跟喷气燃料似的。还没喝到第四杯你估计就躺平了。别说我没警告过你。","roundId":"group_round_1781759382770_qr7bja9","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"group_1781738081642","_id":4392},{"id":1781766348415,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"823d41d3-a739-4c7f-ad03-55f7bd53cf24","senderName":"Keegan","text":"Numbered glasses for a blind tasting? Just make sure you can still read those numbers after the first three, Kid.","timestamp":"2026-06-18T05:10:08.907Z","translation":"盲品还给杯子编号了？孩子，只要确保喝完前三杯你还能看清那些数字就行。","roundId":"group_round_1781759382770_qr7bja9","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"group_1781738081642","_id":4393},{"id":1781766348416,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"8d279dcf-8bd7-42cb-9c2e-360a084898f7","senderName":"Nikto","text":"(Алкоголь развязывает язык. Нам это не нравится.) You should stay sober. It is safer for you.","timestamp":"2026-06-18T05:10:11.747Z","translation":"(酒精会让舌头变大。我们不喜欢这样。) 你应该保持清醒。这对你来说更安全。","roundId":"group_round_1781759382770_qr7bja9","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"group_1781738081642","_id":4394},{"id":1781766348417,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"876f70e0-1f99-4303-8942-b51f215c8cfe","senderName":"König","text":"They are so small... like toy glasses. But the smell of that white spirit is very... piercing. Be careful.","timestamp":"2026-06-18T05:10:16.319Z","translation":"它们好小……像玩具杯子。但那种白酒的味道非常……刺鼻。小心点。","roundId":"group_round_1781759382770_qr7bja9","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"group_1781738081642","_id":4395},{"id":1781766348418,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","senderName":"Krueger","text":"@Simon Riley Imagine her trying to walk back to her desk after 'tasting' all six. It’ll be better than any comedy show.","timestamp":"2026-06-18T05:10:18.062Z","translation":"@Simon Riley 想象一下她“品”完这六杯后尝试走回工位的样子。那绝对比任何喜剧秀都好看。","roundId":"group_round_1781759382770_qr7bja9","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"group_1781738081642","_id":4396},{"id":1781766348419,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"7309238e-d722-4aaa-a30c-9223d595723a","senderName":"Simon Riley","text":"She'll probably end up trying to sue the chair for tripping her.","timestamp":"2026-06-18T05:10:20.702Z","translation":"她最后可能会因为椅子绊了她一下而打算起诉那把椅子。","roundId":"group_round_1781759382770_qr7bja9","reactions":["😂"],"userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"group_1781738081642","_id":4397},{"id":1781766348420,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","senderName":"Krueger","text":"表情包：偷看","timestamp":"2026-06-18T05:10:21.902Z","sticker":"https://img.cdn1.vip/i/69c5463d16c89_1774536253.gif","stickerMeaning":"偷看","roundId":"group_round_1781759382770_qr7bja9","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"group_1781738081642","_id":4398},{"id":1781766348421,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"8d279dcf-8bd7-42cb-9c2e-360a084898f7","senderName":"Nikto","text":"(Мы будем наблюдать. Если она упадет, мы узнаем.) Do not drink them all at once.","timestamp":"2026-06-18T05:10:26.927Z","translation":"(我们会看着。如果她倒下了，我们会知道。) 不要一次性全喝了。","roundId":"group_round_1781759382770_qr7bja9","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"group_1781738081642","_id":4399},{"id":1781766348422,"sender":"them","text":"If you start feeling dizzy, send me a voice note. I want to hear how much of a mess you are.","timestamp":"2026-06-18T05:10:30.298Z","source":"group_dm","groupId":"group_1781738081642","groupName":"Krueger、Simon Riley、Keegan...","translation":"如果你开始觉得头晕了，给我发条语音。我想听听你醉成什么样了。","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","_id":4400},{"id":1781766348423,"sender":"them","text":"Are you actually required to drink that for work? Or are you just being reckless?","timestamp":"2026-06-18T05:10:33.472Z","source":"group_dm","groupId":"group_1781738081642","groupName":"Krueger、Simon Riley、Keegan...","translation":"你工作真的需要喝那个吗？还是你只是在胡闹？","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"7309238e-d722-4aaa-a30c-9223d595723a","_id":4401},{"id":"pat_1781759433501_8ubx4","sender":"system","type":"pat","text":"Keegan拍了拍渡峥的头并让她少喝点","rawContent":"Keegan拍了拍渡峥的头并让她少喝点","timestamp":"2026-06-18T05:10:33.501Z","time":"13:10","patMeta":{"direction":"char_to_user","template":"Keegan拍了拍渡峥的头并让她少喝点","fromCharName":"Keegan"},"roundId":"group_round_1781759382770_qr7bja9","userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"group_1781738081642","_id":4402},{"id":1781765419838,"text":"需要啊","sender":"me","time":"14:50","timestamp":1781765429528,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"7309238e-d722-4aaa-a30c-9223d595723a","_id":4403},{"id":1781765419839,"text":"那是我的工作","sender":"me","time":"14:50","timestamp":1781765433116,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"7309238e-d722-4aaa-a30c-9223d595723a","_id":4404},{"id":1781765419840,"text":"我要学习怎么品鉴","sender":"me","time":"14:50","timestamp":1781765442752,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"7309238e-d722-4aaa-a30c-9223d595723a","_id":4405},{"id":1781765419841,"text":"不用喝多","sender":"me","time":"14:50","timestamp":1781765445698,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"7309238e-d722-4aaa-a30c-9223d595723a","_id":4406},{"id":1781765419842,"text":"几口就行","sender":"me","time":"14:50","timestamp":1781765448867,"replyTo":null,"reactions":[{"emoji":"🤨","roundId":"round_1781765449326_shd244hr4"}],"userId":"uid_1781292326366_zb3q4wlkd","characterId":"7309238e-d